{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"dialect explained the things; they are very nice rooms, bulletproof and dry. — But I am not dry; I must truly put on the third shirt today; you see that I do not lack in movement, also in marching, and that the hardships keep me in good health. Now it is time for dinner, and although satiated from the delicious grapes, I will still let it taste good to me. Tomorrow I will probably arrive in Bonn; it is raining unceasingly this afternoon, I have therefore overslept; the day after tomorrow to Cölln. Where you should address letters to me, I can hardly tell you anymore; I will not be able to receive an answer to this letter before 12 days, by then I will have long since passed Brussels; to Amsterdam via Emden, later Hamburg.... Greetings especially to Mr. Privy Councillor Schulze; — this evening I intend to visit Mr. Government Councillor Lange."}}],"created":1795220606,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":201,"prompt_tokens":286,"total_tokens":487,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-Hm8Ig558zAXR7Hb0HQIXRLffAk5AXico","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":286,"prompt_ms":420.847,"prompt_per_token_ms":1.471493006993007,"prompt_per_second":679.5818908059224,"predicted_n":201,"predicted_ms":4693.14,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.465700000000002,"predicted_per_second":42.61539182722015}}